# VCS / metadata
**/.git
**/.github
.gitattributes

# Project tooling that shouldn't ship in the image
**/.omc
**/.claude
**/.vscode
**/docs

# Secrets — never ship into images
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Dev-only artifacts
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.pnpm-store
**/.vitest-cache
**/.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Docker meta — these aren't needed inside the build context
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.*.yml
Caddyfile

# Markdown and other docs (not needed for a runtime image)
**/*.md
README.md

# OS junk
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Editor swap files
**/*.swp
**/*~
